&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;As a Security Engineer in our team, you will collaborate with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;about 30 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;customer-oriented teams managing critical system environments. Your role will be pivotal in ensuring the safety of Schuberg Philis and its customers by preventing incidents, responding to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;threats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; and supporting our customer teams. Engage closely with engineers, our customer teams, external experts, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;vendors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; and stakeholders to drive projects and implement solutions that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;benefit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; all teams within Schuberg Philis &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; from concept to realization to adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
