&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;In this role, you will work with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; technologies, spanning private and public clouds&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;VMs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; to serverless&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; all highly automated. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;As a hands-on Security Engineer, your skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; will be put to the test in a diverse technological landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
