&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBO degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum 3-5 years&#39; experience in supply chain, customer service or sales support Strong written/verbal communication in English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work in a variety of systems (ERP systems, CRM, Service Management Systems, WMS/TMS)&lt;/p&gt;
