&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic import and export knowledge&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to commute to primary place of work at AtriCure Service Center in Den Bosch, The&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Strong MS Excel skills&lt;/li&gt;
